{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/recruitment-of-a-new-commissioner-to-the-civil-service-commissioners-for-northern-ireland","content_id":"adc0eb3d-4d3d-4e9e-ba22-37c31ee8f25c","description":"The Secretary of State for Northern Ireland invites applications for the appointment of a new Commissioner to the Civil Service Commissioners for Northern Ireland.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Secretary of State for Northern Ireland invites applications for the appointment of a new Commissioner to the Civil Service Commissioners for Northern Ireland.</p>\n\n<p>Further details for the position of Commissioner and the application pack are available for download <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://apply-for-public-appointment.service.gov.uk/roles/9397\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Further information can be requested by email to CSC2026@nio.gov.uk. </p>\n\n<p>All applications should be submitted online where possible on the Cabinet Office website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://apply-for-public-appointment.service.gov.uk/roles\">https://apply-for-public-appointment.service.gov.uk/roles</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"extended-deadline\">EXTENDED DEADLINE</h2>\n<p>The closing date for applications has been extended to <strong>Friday, 24 July 2026</strong> at 12 noon. Late or incomplete applications will not be accepted.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"equality-of-opportunity\">Equality of Opportunity</h2>\n\n<p>We welcome applications from all suitably experienced individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion or belief, political opinion, sexual orientation, age, disability and gender/sex.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"EXTENDED DEADLINE: The closing date for applications has been extended to Friday, 24 July 2026 at 12 noon. Late or incomplete applications will not be accepted.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-09T12:06:37Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-18T13:28:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["234148b2-66d6-457c-9d06-2bf2b98533ca"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/png","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1d080bdf716392f203/s216_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1de84ae1fd8592f1ec/s300_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1c92bb81fcdbe7b6e5/s465_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1d92bb81fcdbe7b6e6/s630_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1de84ae1fd8592f1eb/s712_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1c366f494ab2e7b725/s960_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-06-18T14:28:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/recruitment-of-a-new-commissioner-to-the-civil-service-commissioners-for-northern-ireland","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/recruitment-of-a-new-commissioner-to-the-civil-service-commissioners-for-northern-ireland","base_path":"/government/news/recruitment-of-a-new-commissioner-to-the-civil-service-commissioners-for-northern-ireland","content_id":"adc0eb3d-4d3d-4e9e-ba22-37c31ee8f25c","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-09T12:06:37Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Recruitment of a new Commissioner to the Civil Service Commissioners for Northern Ireland","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/recruitment-of-a-new-commissioner-to-the-civil-service-commissioners-for-northern-ireland","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D19","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/northern-ireland-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/northern-ireland-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/northern-irela